// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Review round-3 gap-fill: asOfDate / termDates date-relationship behavior
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

// 用例目的：asOfDate 晚于全部 termDates —— 文档声明包装器不检查先后关系，实测宽松接受，记录实际行为
@testing:case="createOptionQuoteMatrix accepts asOfDate after termDates (no validation)"
rOQM_aot = caplib::createOptionQuoteMatrix("OQVT_PRICE", "OQTT_ABSOLUTE_TERM", "OQST_ABSOLUTE_STRIKE", "EUROPEAN", "SPOT_UNDERLYING_TYPE", 2023.06.09, [], quoteTermDates, quotePayoffTypes, quoteValues, quoteStrikes, "TF_UNDERLYING", "TF_OQM_R3_AOT", false)
assert 1, typestr(rOQM_aot) != "VOID"

